# The idle watchdog (LC_IDLE=15s, scaled): the prompt NEVER returns (hang) -> the card
# must auto-Play instead of trapping the Mini before a game. The scenario passing at all
# (instead of TIMEOUT) proves the watchdog fires and the launch proceeds.
desc launch card: prompt never returns -> idle watchdog auto-Plays, no trap
invoke wrap
config paired
wifi up
sdfile+ Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
engine 0|101\t2026-07-01 10:00\tBrick\t32KB\tCURRENT\nLOCAL=current
engine 0|RESULT mode=list-states n=0
pick hang
expect_exit 0
expect_trace HANG (waiting for the watchdog)
expect_trace STOCK GBA rom=
expect_trace_absent ENGINE --sync-save
expect_log card action=play (cancel/idle)
